Subject: [PATCH] Integrate Infineon FMAC for Linux 6.18.20

The Infineon FMAC patch is not publicly released and has not been
included in the current branch contents pending Infineon's official release.

This file contains no driver code and is not an applicable kernel patch.
The kernel recipe still references this filename; kernel patching will fail
until this placeholder is replaced with the officially released patch.

After Infineon's public release, Murata will restore the released patch
at this path and validate it against NXP Linux 6.18.20 before building the image.
